{'symbol': 'BRK-B', 'date': '2023-06-21 20:00:00', 'title': 'BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY INC. NEWS RELEASE', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--(BRK.A; BRK.B) – TODAY, WARREN E. BUFFETT HAS CONVERTED 9,129 A SHARES INTO 13,693,500 B SHARES IN ORDER TO DONATE 13,693,432 SHARES OF BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY “B” STOCK TO FIVE FOUNDATIONS: 10,453,008 TO THE BILL & MELINDA GATES FOUNDATION TRUST, 1,045,300 SHARES TO THE SUSAN THOMPSON BUFFETT FOUNDATION AND 731,708 SHARES TO EACH OF THE SHERWOOD FOUNDATION, HOWARD G. BUFFETT FOUNDATION AND NOVO FOUNDATION. THE DONATIONS HAVE BEEN DELIVERED TODAY.'}